{"about_the_game":"From the artists behind the smash hit Towerfall comes the critically-acclaimed Out There Somewhere.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as an astronaut stranded on a strange and dangerous alien planet.  Low on fuel, your only hope for escape is to make your way to the planet\u2019s core.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt will take brains and quick reflexes to survive in this incredibly clever action platformer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cOut There Somewhere isn't a normal game, though: it's a platformer with a devious twist and a truly shocking difficulty curve. It's a platformer with a very late level, for example, that contains absolutely no platforms at all - just empty space and a doorway right near the ceiling. This is challenging stuff, but it's wonderfully creative with it, and I'm not sure I can recommend it enough.\u201d  <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Eurogamer 9/10","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Dig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/b9bb009e6be7946039094743ed61ed916e06d159.jpg"},{"name":"Light Bridges","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/6206bb7ace8831bac7c1c4ea45b7d8202a865ccf.jpg"},{"name":"Beam me up, Scotty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/daf3744a0f9f30c750bcead541d8c2b6d6e7c93f.jpg"},{"name":"Permission denied","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/2ce30084460c5b4ee79686510ff0807b0f75e6ec.jpg"},{"name":"Mirror mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/a14b134d055beb149d6a1c0fe02767630c751973.jpg"},{"name":"Teleport machine gun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/cab5aeb005ca4bfaeb166cb1f226d9cc41b27a2c.jpg"},{"name":"Rasputin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/263980/0a39e88001d96085540b8c33941e51e8e23de229.jpg"},